-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data

The MIT License above covers the code in scripts/ only. The files in data/
and outputs/ are derived from public data sets that keep their own terms:

  * USGS Watershed Boundary Dataset, NHDPlus V2, NWIS and NLDI (U.S. Geological
    Survey; U.S. EPA for NHDPlus V2): U.S. Government works, public domain.
  * NLCD 2001 and 2021 (MRLC consortium / USGS): public domain.
  * USFWS National Wetlands Inventory: public domain; see the USFWS NWI data
    limitations and use statement.
  * Water Quality Portal (USGS, U.S. EPA, National Water Quality Monitoring
    Council): data are provided by the contributing organizations (here
    mainly the Louisiana Department of Environmental Quality and USGS) under
    their own terms; please cite the Water Quality Portal and the providers.

Derived tables and figures may be reused with attribution to this repository
and to the original data providers.
